go between data centers.

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:50.210
What this means for you is that
you get super low latencies,

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:54.860
a consistent throughput,
fast VM boot up times,

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:57.860
and autoscaling that just works.

00:03:57.860 --> 00:04:00.590
