00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:34.290
If you see our
Windows pricing, it's

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:37.540
$0.04 per core, per hour,
for all your VM types.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:41.140
So if you want to understand
what your cost is going to be,

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:43.740
