00:04:56.340 --> 00:05:01.020
We announced the committed
use discount program today.

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:02.760
If you want to
look at longer term

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:04.830
commitments for your
steady state workloads,

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:07.600
we have that option too.

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:10.150
One of the biggest
things that customers

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:11.780
