00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:26.390
And this is really a
great, unique capability

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:28.160
on our platform
that will allow you

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:33.420
to have more reliable backup
and disaster recovery solutions.

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:34.940
So now we've set up all our VMs.

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:37.490
