or even try this work,

00:45:18.700 --> 00:45:20.650
go ahead and find us on Slack.

00:45:20.650 --> 00:45:22.480
You can also visit
our GitHub page.

00:45:22.480 --> 00:45:25.570
And we encourage
everybody that's

00:45:25.570 --> 00:45:28.690
passionate about Windows,
passionate about orchestrators

00:45:28.690 --> 00:45:31.300
and cluster managers, to
come along, go ahead and get

00:45:31.300 --> 00:45:32.080
